/3148_2362/20180331_124045.jpg","url":"https://www.theglasspantry.com/quick-turkey-ramen-pho","_id":"9fd74548-f726-4761-a7f5-06ec93a01b92","_owner":"577c92d8-55f7-4f98-88a2-d8647b1c2c9c","_createdDate":{"$date":"2018-04-29T17:37:09.835Z"},"_updatedDate":{"$date":"2018-04-29T20:53:59.347Z"},"ingredients":"<p>Ingredients</p>\n\n<p>​</p>\n\n<p>For the Soup&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>4-6 cups Stock of your choice</p>\n\n<p>1 black cardamom Pod</p>\n\n<p>2 lime leaves (optional)</p>\n\n<p>2-3 thick slices fresh ginger</p>\n\n<p>1 or 2 Star Anise Pods</p>\n\n<p>​</p>\n\n<p>The Noodles</p>\n\n<p>1 1/2 - 3 cups Turkey Ramen Stir Fry</p>\n\n<p>​</p>\n\n<p>The Toppings</p>\n\n<p>1/2 cup chopped cilantro</p>\n\n<p>1/2 cup chopped scallion</p>\n\n<p>1 or 2 sliced Thai, Serrano or</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Jalapeno peppers</p>\n\n<p>1/2 cup torn Thai basil leaves</p>\n\n<p>1/2 package Enoki Mushrooms</p>\n\n<p><span class=\"wixGuard\">​</span></p>","catagory":"Soups & Stews","instructions":"<p>Method</p>\n\n<p>​</p>\n\n<p>Place the thawed&nbsp;stock into&nbsp;a pot and heat it over a medium heat setting adding the fresh ginger slices, star anise,&nbsp;a black cardamom pod and lime leaves (if using).&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Method</p>\n\n<p><span class=\"wixGuard\">​</span></p>\n\n<p>After the broth has come to a simmer allow it to simmer for 15 minutes, then turn up the heat and get it really hot about (15 minutes )while&nbsp;preparing&nbsp;the fresh herbs for the topping.</p>\n\n<p>​​</p>\n\n<p>Let the ramen warm to room temperature while heating the broth and preparing the toppings.</p>\n\n<p>​</p>\n\n<p>Place&nbsp;some of the ramen stir-fry and enoki mushrooms in a large wide bowl,&nbsp;then top with the hot broth.</p>\n\n<p>​</p>\n\n<p>Serve with the fresh herbs, chili&#39;s and lime wedges.</p>","title":"Quick Turkey Ramen Pho","link-Recipes-catagory-catagory":"/Recipes/catagory/soups-%26-stews"}],"dynamicUrl":"/Recipes/catagory/{ca